WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.835 line:78%
Welcome, {First Name}. If your name isn't available... Welcome, Architect.

00:00:05.885 --> 00:00:09.920 line:78%
Before we begin, I want to ask you a simple question.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:16.519 line:78%
When was the last time you truly felt alive? Not successful. Not busy. Not
productive.

00:00:16.569 --> 00:00:17.769 line:78%
Alive.

00:00:17.819 --> 00:00:25.662 line:78%
That question sits at the heart of this first chapter because every Back Half begins
with an awakening.

00:00:25.712 --> 00:00:30.585 line:78%
For many people, life changes because something happens to them.

00:00:30.635 --> 00:00:37.793 line:78%
For others, life changes because they decide they can no longer ignore what they
already know.

00:00:37.843 --> 00:00:45.686 line:78%
This chapter invites you to pause long enough to hear what your life may already be
trying to tell you.

00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:51.447 line:78%
As you move through these pages, don't worry about finding perfect answers.

00:00:51.497 --> 00:00:57.664 line:78%
Simply tell yourself the truth. Because awareness is where transformation begins.

00:00:57.714 --> 00:01:00.050 line:78%
When you're ready... Let's begin Chapter One.
